      "id": "story_1149_p0_c0",
      "chunk_index": 0,
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "sentence_index": 0,
      "text": "私は今日は七時に起きて、何かを食べました。",
      "text_en": "I got up at seven today and had something to eat.",
